# Webhook retries

## Requirements

:::requirement{#R1 status=accepted} Retry failed deliveries
A failed webhook delivery is retried up to 5 times.
:::

:::acceptance{#AC1 verifies=R1} Retries stop at the limit
Given an endpoint that always answers 500, delivery is attempted 6 times in all.
:::

## Tasks

- [x] Implement the retry loop :depends[R1] {#T1}
- [x] Read the retry policy from retry.json {#T2}

